<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Aug CPI 0.3 pct M/M, 22.9 pct Y/Y - CSO.</title>
<headline>Hungary Aug CPI 0.3 pct M/M, 22.9 pct Y/Y - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's consumer prices in Aug rose 0.3 percent compared to July and were up 22.9 percent on August 1995, the Central Statistical Office (CSO) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)</p>
<p>				  Aug 96     July 96	 Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month (pct)   +0.3	   +0.4	   +0.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year (pct)    +22.9	  +23.0	  +29.2</p>
<p>Change of sub-indices from December 1995, July 1996 and August 1995:</p>
<p>			 Pct of Dec 95   Monthly  Yr-on-yr CPI-weight</p>
<p>   Foods			 109.5    -0.5     +18.6     28.4</p>
<p>   Alcohol/tobacco	   120.0    +1.0     +28.5	9.5</p>
<p>   Clothes		     111.8    -0.9     +25.8	7.5</p>
<p>   Durable consumer goods  108.4    +0.9     +14.4	7.4</p>
<p>   Household energy	  119.7    +0.9     +30.4	6.5</p>
<p>   Other products, fuel    114.8    +0.8     +23.8     17.3</p>
<p>   Services		    119.7    +0.6     +24.8     23.4</p>
<p>   TOTAL			 114.6    +0.3     +22.9    100.0</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
